.TH "INSPEKT\-RECORD" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-record \- Record browser interactions to a YAML file.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]record\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
\f[I]SUBCOMMAND\f[R] [\f[I]ARGS\f[R]]\&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record browser interactions to a YAML file.
.PP
Starts recording all user actions on the currently open browser page.
Press Ctrl+C to stop recording and save the file.
.PP
The recording captures:
.IP \(bu 2
Clicks, typing, and keyboard navigation
.IP \(bu 2
Form submissions and downloads
.IP \(bu 2
Page navigations and scrolling
.IP \(bu 2
Optional: hover events, state snapshots
.PP
\f[B]Key Options:\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-include\-hover\f[R]: Capture hover events (longer recordings)
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-mask\-passwords\f[R]: Replace password input with asterisks
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-replay\f[R]: Immediately replay after recording
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-interactive\f[R]: Show dialog popover with controls
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-capture\-state\f[R]: Snapshot localStorage/cookies
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-faithful\f[R]: Capture focus styles for pixel\-perfect replay
.PP
\f[B]Subcommands:\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]tutorial\f[R]: Interactive tutorial for the record command
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]list\f[R]: List all recordings in the default directory
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]open\f[R]: Open a recording file in your default YAML editor
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]rename\f[R]: Rename a recording file
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\f[I]FILENAME\f[R]
optional text argument
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\-o\f[R], \f[B]\(enoutput\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
Output filename (auto\-generated if not specified)
.TP
\f[B]\(eninclude\-hover\f[R]
Record hover events on interactive elements
.TP
\f[B]\(enmask\-passwords\f[R]
Mask password input values in recording
.TP
\f[B]\(enmin\-hover\-duration\f[R], \f[I]INTEGER\f[R]
Minimum hover duration in ms to record (default: 200)
.TP
\f[B]\(enreplay\f[R]
Automatically replay the recording after saving to verify it works
.TP
\f[B]\(enopen\f[R]
Open the recording in default application after saving
.TP
\f[B]\(enreveal\f[R]
Reveal the recording in file explorer after saving
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-audio\f[R]
Disable audio feedback during replay (requires \(enreplay)
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-visual\f[R]
Disable visual feedback during replay (requires \(enreplay)
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-feedback\f[R]
Disable both audio and visual feedback during replay (requires
\(enreplay)
.TP
\f[B]\-i\f[R], \f[B]\(eninteractive\f[R]
Step through replay manually (requires \(enreplay)
.TP
\f[B]\-n\f[R], \f[B]\(ennative\f[R]
Use native OS keyboard events during replay (macOS only, requires
\(enreplay)
.TP
\f[B]\(entyping\-speed\f[R], \f[I][instant|fast|normal|slow]\f[R]
Typing speed for native replay mode (requires \(enreplay \(ennative)
(default: \f[CR]normal\f[R])
.TP
\f[B]\(encapture\-state\f[R]
Capture cookies, localStorage, and scroll position for replay
.TP
\f[B]\(enstorage\-keys\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
Comma\-separated list of localStorage/sessionStorage keys to capture
.TP
\f[B]\(enchecksum\f[R]
Generate DOM structure checksum for state verification
.TP
\f[B]\(ensynthetic\-dialogs\f[R]
Use non\-blocking HTML overlays for alert/confirm/prompt (for
automation)
.TP
\f[B]\(enmatch\-viewport\f[R]
Mark viewport size as a requirement for faithful replay
.TP
\f[B]\(enmatch\-zoom\-level\f[R]
Mark zoom level as a requirement for faithful replay
.TP
\f[B]\-f\f[R], \f[B]\(enforce\f[R]
Override existing file without prompting
.TP
\f[B]\(enviewport\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
Resize browser to specific viewport before recording (e.g., 1024x768)
.TP
\f[B]\(enfaithful\f[R]
Capture focus styles for pixel\-perfect keyboard navigation replay
(experimental)
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-milliseconds\f[R]
Hide milliseconds in timestamps (default: show milliseconds)
